              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyakudla ngokuchichimayo, nisuthe, nilidumise igama likaJehova uNkulunkulu wenu oniphathe ngokumangalisayo; futhi abantu bami abayikujabha kuze kube phakade.",
