              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyokwazi ukuthi ngiphakathi kuka-Israyeli nokuthi nginguJehova uNkulunkulu wenu, akasiye omunye; futhi abantu bami abayikujabha kuze kube phakade.",
