              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokho ngiyakuthulula uMoya wami phezu kwayo yonke inyama; amadodana enu namadodakazi enu ayakuprofetha, amaxhegu enu aphuphe amaphupho, nezinsizwa zenu zibone imibono.",
          "type": "text",
